{"3954990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "S.A.N.D.Y. - Beach Cleaner", "steam_appid": 3954990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no more land left to bury the dead. Meanwhile, the planet is drowning in trash, car exhaust, and oil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the strange happenings on the beach of a once-top resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/34926e5abc04cfc1001aea29ad0100b1.poster.avif?t=1787902185\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/34926e5abc04cfc1001aea29ad0100b1.webm?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/34926e5abc04cfc1001aea29ad0100b1.mp4?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a bot, a beach cleaner and trash sorter named S.A.N.D.Y. - Sweeper &amp; Neutralizer of Debris (Yours). For your happiness, it's enough that human eyeglasses stay on your camera. And year after year, you work diligently, no matter what. Thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/432c0f918570fc848b17668a829b969d.poster.avif?t=1787902185\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/432c0f918570fc848b17668a829b969d.webm?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/432c0f918570fc848b17668a829b969d.mp4?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the marked beach area → Sort the collected trash for disposal → Rescue the animals → A new area  is unlocked → Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you will develop the story and upgrade your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/fe8f8bf71102527a18d0caed3a413967.poster.avif?t=1787902185\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/fe8f8bf71102527a18d0caed3a413967.webm?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/fe8f8bf71102527a18d0caed3a413967.mp4?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no more land left to bury the dead. Meanwhile, the planet is drowning in trash, car exhaust, and oil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the strange happenings on the beach of a once-top resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/34926e5abc04cfc1001aea29ad0100b1.poster.avif?t=1787902185\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/34926e5abc04cfc1001aea29ad0100b1.webm?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/34926e5abc04cfc1001aea29ad0100b1.mp4?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a bot, a beach cleaner and trash sorter named S.A.N.D.Y. - Sweeper &amp; Neutralizer of Debris (Yours). For your happiness, it's enough that human eyeglasses stay on your camera. And year after year, you work diligently, no matter what. Thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/432c0f918570fc848b17668a829b969d.poster.avif?t=1787902185\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/432c0f918570fc848b17668a829b969d.webm?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/432c0f918570fc848b17668a829b969d.mp4?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the marked beach area → Sort the collected trash for disposal → Rescue the animals → A new area  is unlocked → Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you will develop the story and upgrade your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/fe8f8bf71102527a18d0caed3a413967.poster.avif?t=1787902185\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/fe8f8bf71102527a18d0caed3a413967.webm?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/fe8f8bf71102527a18d0caed3a413967.mp4?t=1787902185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Clean up trash from the beach in this short, relaxing, and grim game! Recycle waste, upgrade your robot. Explore new territories. Clean up oil spills and save the animals!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/4d1ff4c3c2e2f013bf432a7c690d6b913899c9df/header.jpg?t=1787902185", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/0625d16b547a49dddeb54bd635c6a7c7229a1015/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787902185", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/0625d16b547a49dddeb54bd635c6a7c7229a1015/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787902185", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit OS required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel CPU Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit OS required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel CPU Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "